Z||000006||Carrolles||09-04-2001||03:58 PM||||The overflow tank is made of thermoplastic, either polypropylene or polyethylene.  Anyway you can weld the hole shut.  I use a solder gun to heat the affected area and remelt the crack shut.  Scrape a bit of plastic from a thick area of the tank and use it as filler material when welding up a hole.<P>It's worked for me for years an many cars.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Old Lar||09-04-2001||04:04 PM||||Fiero Store has them also.||||reg||1
